<% set_page_title("Non-Crown organisation participation") %>
<div class="govuk-grid-row">
  <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">
    <h1 class="govuk-heading-l">Non-Crown organisation participation</h1>
    <p class="govuk-body">The GOV.UH Forms service is preparing the appropriate participation terms for public bodies that are not Crown organisations. This is not a document available for acceptance.</p>
    <p class="govuk-body">The previous UK agreement is historical source material and must not be signed for use in United Hampshire. Each participating organisation must have an appropriately authorised representative and approved information processing and service arrangements before entering into an agreement.</p>
    <p class="govuk-body">Contact <%= govuk_link_to "GOV.UH Forms support", support_url %> for the arrangements applicable to your organisation.</p>
  </div>
</div>
